Pollen

This product includes software developed by Perplexity AI Inc. and
contributors to the Bumblebee project (github.com/perplexityai/bumblebee),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Pollen is a derivative work that adds Windows compatibility for use within
the Beekeeper supply-chain safety harness (github.com/bantuson/beekeeper).

Pollen is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by Perplexity AI Inc.
For general-purpose supply-chain scanning on macOS and Linux, use upstream
Bumblebee directly.

Modifications (Apache License 2.0, Section 4(b)): source files in this
repository have been modified from the upstream Bumblebee v0.1.1 release
(pinned commit c24089804ee66ece4bec6f14638cb98985389cdb, 2026-05-22). At a
minimum the Go module path was rewritten from
github.com/perplexityai/bumblebee to github.com/bantuson/pollen across the
source tree; the substantive changes (Windows root resolution, Windows path
representation, and Windows editor/browser/MCP-config coverage) are enumerated
in CHANGES.md, and the upstream provenance and sync workflow are in UPSTREAM.md.
